Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh hey, Kate says hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.60,0:00:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She wonders if you'd meet her at the library,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.58,0:00:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,then you can go out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.88,0:00:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, here's an order for tonight: find a poetry book by Lorca.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's her favourite poet, see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.48,0:00:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Better write it down: L-O-R-C-A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I have to get started.
